<title>USA: Wachovia unit issues $300 mln capital secs.</title>
<headline>Wachovia unit issues $300 mln capital secs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of capital securities, a trust preferred issue, from Wachovia Corp's Wachovia Capital Trust II was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER WACHOVIA CAPITAL TRUST II</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON FLOATING@  MATURITY 1/15/2027</p>
<p>				  LIBOR+50BP</p>
<p>TYPE CAPITAL SECS  ISS PRICE 98.84   FIRST PAY DATE 04/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA3   YIELD LIBOR+60BP  PAY FREQ QUARTER</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS			    CALLABLE NON CALL 10</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
